<title>JAPAN: Mitsui High-tec up on prospect of higher earnings.</title>
<headline>Mitsui High-tec up on prospect of higher earnings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsui High-tec Inc shares rose in afternoon trade in Tokyo on Wednesday, supported by speculation that the recent weakness of the yen against the dollar would help its earnings, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0515 GMT, the shares of the producer of integrated circuit frames was up 130 yen at 2,490, the 13th largest percentage gainer on the first section of the Tokyo bourse.</p>
</text>
